n: 3.13
name: earlier-restarts-and-carrier
kind: hub
is: Of five sibling checkouts of the old body, one was a restart: a C rewrite of the seed (2026-11-06 to 11-08) that grew from 1,574 lines and 24 operations to 10,302 and 254 in 56 hours, stayed about 40 times slower, and landed only its Form half, on the old C. The other restart is on main: a 1,199-line carrier written from the axioms (2026-11-05). It passes 31 checks on arm64, has no reader or image source, and its store fills after 3,947 offers. About 460 of its lines can be kept; a standalone C bootstrap is estimated at 1,800 to 2,200 lines.
at: 2026-11-24

n: 3.13.1
name: attempts
kind: hub
is: The five sibling checkouts are worktrees of one repository. One held a restart: a C rewrite of the seed that grew 6.5 times in 56 hours while covering the old surface again, stayed about 40 times slower, and landed only its Form half on the old C as one 200-file commit. A second witness for a rewritten runtime was built eight hours after the rewrite began. The reading names six causes of not carrying.
at: 2026-11-24

n: 3.13.1.2
name: rewrite-seed-growth
kind: observation
is: Commit b21a77483 of 2026-11-06 10:05 replaced the 32,016-line seed with 1,574 lines: an S-expression reader, an evaluator with six frame kinds and 24 registered operations. Lines and operations at later commits: 3,875 and 79, 7,222 and 186, 10,139 and 254, then 10,302 and 254 at 803ce20d8 on 2026-11-08 18:01, 56 hours after the first.
status: observed
src: 2.21.11#1-5 2.21.11#237-243 2.21.12
limit: The 10,302-line final file was read only at its header and its value struct and by counts of its functions.
at: 2026-11-24

n: 3.13.1.3
name: rewrite-receipts
kind: observation
is: The rewrite's receipts of 2026-11-06 record that every body-wide door ended at its first unbound host name, that 58 of the registry's 124 names were missing, that one door ran past 180 s near 1.5 GB, and the debt 'move the reader back onto that authority and remove the duplicate C parsing paths'. The last rewrite commit defines 32 parse_ functions, 24 of them named parse_bml_.
status: observed
src: 2.21.13#31-38 2.21.13#54-63 2.21.13#255-261 2.21.14#131-132 2.21.12
