kind: observation
is: The message of the rewrite's last commit, 803ce20d8 of 2026-11-08 18:01, says 11 of 19 gate rows pass under a 30 to 60 s cap and 'The evaluator remains about 40x slower than main's (op-manifest 39 s against 1 s)'. The same message names a 552-byte frame that had been copied two or three times per evaluated argument.
status: observed
